// The light end of the network: 49E1 rails on wooden sleepers at 63 cm, the
// Reichsbahn section (149 mm high, 125 mm foot) still standard on lightly
// loaded branch lines and in sidings. The bed is thinner there than on a main
// line — 20 cm under the sleeper instead of 30 — and the shoulder narrower.
